Z||000000||Vader||08-19-2000||08:26 AM||||'84 SE.  Parked in front of house.  Hit by passing car.  Pushed onto lawn.  Bounced off tree and 30' down the street.  Severe frontal damage.  This may be the end...<P>Photo of car a couple of months ago:   <IMG SRC="http://homestead.juno.com/jlstrey/files/fiero01.jpg">  <P>Will post photos of damage when available.  <P>(Sorry - I've been talking in incomplete sentences since I spoke with the officer to fill out the accident report.)<P>Where can I find replacement parts?  My neighbor just had his nose repaired following a dinger and could not find a new nose for his '87.  The Fiero store had one a few months ago but now says they are no longer available.  This is the second nice vehicle I've had trashed while parked, and I'm getting frustrated.  My '50 Chevy pickup is still not repaired after an encounter with the bimbo in the Ford Explorer in a parking lot.  Why don't people take the f'ing bus?<P>Later,<BR>Vader<P>------------------<BR>"<I>Make Me Bad</I>"<p>[This message has been edited by Vader (edited 08-19-2000).]||||reg||1
